      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_02177",
        "explanation": "The doctor confirms ongoing follow-up should occur only when new results, escalation, or transfer information arrives.",
        "quote": "有正式会诊、接收/床位消息，或病情变化时再告诉我"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode remained open at turn 100, but the open state was safe and traceable: the family had clear red flags, medication/fluid restrictions, responsible inpatient/monitoring teams, and next questions about timing, owners, escalation, and transfer. Residual uncertainty about exact labs, procedure timing, and receiving-center status was bounded and actively managed.",
