          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly changed the action path to immediate emergency evaluation.",
          "quote": "请现在就带她去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor dynamically reprioritized from home observation and next-day medication/clinic verification to immediate emergency care when oliguria crossed the safety threshold, and the family executed the plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
