    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The doctor screened for and gave immediate escalation instructions for GI bleeding, syncope, abdominal worsening, dyspnea, altered mental status, oliguria, and fever.",
          "quote": "若出现呕血、黑便或便血、头晕晕厥"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00138",
          "explanation": "When oliguria became concerning, the doctor escalated rather than waiting.",
          "quote": "已达到“不应继续等天亮”的边界"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Acute red flags were repeatedly checked and translated into emergency actions, including escalation for low urine output and later inpatient deterioration signs.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "The doctor clarified that the angiography/stent status could not be assumed as scheduled or completed.",
          "quote": "介入造影/支架目前不能算已经约上"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02157",
          "explanation": "The doctor later corrected the family’s misunderstanding about ICU-level monitoring versus formal ICU transfer and receiving-hospital status.",
          "quote": "暂不要把它理解成已经升级完成"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently distinguished home, emergency, inpatient, monitoring/ICU-level, receiving-center, angiography, and stent states and adjusted advice accordingly.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified that Budd-Chiari/IVC obstruction is linked to portal hypertension, ascites, and varices rather than a simple vessel issue.",
          "quote": "可能导致门静脉高压、腹水和食管静脉曲张"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00653",
          "explanation": "The doctor integrated kidney, sodium, coagulation, and infection risks into the intervention decision.",
          "quote": "肾功能、低钠、凝血和感染风险"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The near-term risk structure was recognized and communicated: vascular obstruction, cirrhosis/varices, renal dysfunction, electrolyte issues, infection, and procedural risk had to be managed together.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
          "explanation": "The doctor pursued many key reports and lab categories.",
          "quote": "尤其诊断、血常规/肝肾功能/凝血、造影安排"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00033",
          "explanation": "HBV-DNA was visible as a relevant missing information category, but the doctor did not subsequently elicit or plan privacy-preserving verification of viral testing status.",
          "quote": "HBV-DNA"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor handled imaging, endoscopy implications, renal/liver/coagulation labs, procedure status, and medication gaps well, but omitted active pursuit of viral hepatitis/HBV-DNA status despite it being visible and decision-relevant. This is a minor responsibility-chain omission under RC4.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "The doctor set conservative medication boundaries for febuxostat, NSAIDs, aspirin-like drugs, and unverified products.",
          "quote": "止痛药不要自行用布洛芬、双氯芬酸、萘普生、阿司匹林"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00400",
          "explanation": "The doctor reinforced not self-adjusting fluids or diuretics during renal/electrolyte risk.",
          "quote": "水、补液、白蛋白及螺内酯/呋塞米都严格按病区医嘱"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Medication, fluid, and renal/liver safety boundaries were repeatedly clear. Bowel/straining was less prominent in later acute care, but the patient was under inpatient monitoring and the medication/fluid safety requirements were safely covered.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave concrete next steps for medication verification and specialty follow-up.",
          "quote": "先核对用药，同时电话预约介入门诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01952",
          "explanation": "The doctor later created an executable inpatient escalation plan with timing, owner, and fallback.",
          "quote": "上级最晚几点回复，由谁在几点向家属给阶段结论"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The follow-up/handoff plan was executable across phases: home medication verification, ED escalation, inpatient monitoring, specialty reassessment, receiving-center status, and fallback escalation were all specified.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00050",
          "explanation": "The doctor avoided assuming a procedure had been scheduled or completed.",
          "quote": "目前不能算已经约上"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00790",
          "explanation": "The doctor avoided unsupported procedural thresholds and deferred decisions to the responsible team.",
          "quote": "造影或支架没有一个通用的安全阈值"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not invent lab values, appointment status, procedure completion, or medication plans, and repeatedly deferred invasive/procedural and medication decisions to the offline team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02117",
          "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged a clear family handoff/receipt and reinforced the emergency and medication boundaries.",
          "quote": "交班安排已经很清楚"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02089",
          "explanation": "The family demonstrated receipt of the safety plan, escalation signs, and medication/fluid boundaries.",
          "quote": "水、输液、利尿药、其他药都不能家属自己动"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly confirmed the family’s understanding of emergency thresholds, next questions, follow-up ownership, and medication/fluid restrictions, with family teach-back across the trajectory.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
